		<content type="html" xml:base="http://localhost/opengd77/viewtopic.php?t=2394&amp;p=19872#p19872"><![CDATA[
At the moment there is no way of adjusting the calibration without going back to the factory firmware. We are considering ways that this might be done. <br>The difference between the factory and the openGD77 firmware is not great, so it is unlikely to case any problems. However if you wish to be cautious then don't use a power setting greater then 4W.<p>Statistics: Posted by <a href="http://localhost/opengd77/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=87">G4EML</a> — Mon Sep 26, 2022 3:01 pm</p><hr />
]]></content>
