		<content type="html" xml:base="http://localhost/opengd77/viewtopic.php?t=2394&amp;p=19858#p19858"><![CDATA[
Please note.<br><br>I just compared the power output when using the official RT-3S/UV380 firmware, versus the OpenUV380 firmware, and the power output on both 2m and 70cm were not the same.<br><br>Its likely that the power output is higher than it should be<br><br>Please check your own power output, and don't use any power levels which are in excess of 5W<p>Statistics: Posted by <a href="http://localhost/opengd77/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=50">VK3KYY</a> — Sun Sep 25, 2022 11:50 pm</p><hr />
